ज्ञानसिंहकेतुध्वजराज
Jñānasiṃhaketudhvajarāja, n. of a Buddha: Gv 〔309.20〕.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BHS&page=245,2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bhs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञानसूर्यतेजस्
Jñānasūryatejas, n. of a Bodhisattva: Gv 〔150.7〕.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BHS&page=245,2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bhs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ज्ञानाकर
Jñānākara, n. of a son of the former Buddha Mahābhijñājñānābhibhū: SP 〔160.9〕.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BHS&page=245,2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bhs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

