महावीचि|महावीचिः
mahāvīci (˚cī), f. or m., n. of a hell (= avīci, q.v.): ˚cī Mv 〔i.9.9〕 = ˚ciṃ 〔iii.454.8〕 (the first nom., the second acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BHS&page=426,1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bhs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

महावीर्या|महावीर्य्या
