Ratnavyūha,<BR>(1) nt., n. of a city in the south: Gv 〔201.10〕;<BR>(2) m. (? or nt.), n. of a bodhisattva-paribhoga (see the latter): LV 〔60.18〕; 〔61.12〕 etc.; 〔63.2〕; 〔73.3〕. Tib. renders literally, rin po che bkod pa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BHS&page=452,1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bhs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

