Ratnaśrī,<BR>(1) n. of one, or two, Buddhas: Śikṣ 〔169.8〕; Sukh 〔6.15〕;<BR>(2) n. of a Bodhisattva: Gv 〔4.4〕.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BHS&page=452,1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bhs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

