रत्नामय
rat(a)nāmaya, adj. (Pkt. rayaṇāmaya; = Skt. ratna˚; cf. ratanāmaka), made of jewels: (in prose) Mv 〔i.31.5〕; 〔32.3, 5, 10〕; 〔ii.109.3〕 (twice), 5; others in vss, see 〔§ 8.16〕.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BHS&page=452,2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bhs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

