रत्नार्चिस्
Ratnārcis, n. of one or several Tathāgatas: LV 〔291.6〕; ŚsP 〔34.12〕; Śikṣ 〔169.7〕.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BHS&page=452,2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bhs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

