रत्नोत्तमा
Ratnottamā, n. of a goddess: Mvy 〔4293〕.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BHS&page=452,2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bhs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

