Vajravetālī, n. of a goddess: Sādh 〔352.10〕.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BHS&page=468,1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bhs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

वज्रशुद्ध
Vajraśuddha, n. of a Bodhisattva or future Buddha: Gv 〔441.26〕.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BHS&page=468,1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bhs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

