sarvaprathamam, adv. (= Pali sabbapaṭhamaṃ, Childers), first of all: Mv 〔iii.56.18〕 (prose; mss. sarve pra˚); LV 〔403.4, 6〕; 〔404.18 f.〕<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BHS&page=585,1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bhs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

