sarvabhūtarutagrahaṇī, sc. lipi, a kind of script: LV 〔126.11〕; lit. comprising (or grasping) the cries of all creatures; Tib. renders literally; cf. prec. and sarvarutasaṃgrahaṇī-lipi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BHS&page=585,1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bhs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

