सर्वराज
sarvarāja (cf. Skt. sarvarāj, rare), emperor, universal king: (tasya, sc. to Prince Puṇyaraśmi, son of King Arciṣmant, mātāpitṛbhyāṃ) koṭiḥ kanyānāṃ dattā, jñātisaṃghena koṭiḥ, naigamajānapadaiḥ koṭiḥ, sarvarājena koṭiḥ kanyānāṃ dattā abhūvan RP 〔41.15〕; it seems that sarvarāja must refer to a feudal superior of the princeʼs father, who was a rājan, 〔36.18〕.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BHS&page=585,1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bhs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

सर्वराजेन्द्रा
Sarvarājendrā, n. of a mudrā: Kv 〔74.9, 18〕.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BHS&page=585,2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bhs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

